{:org/id :org-che-wir-mutual-credit
 :org/name "WIR mutual credit circle and business barter networks (Sardex, LETS for firms)"
 :org/entity-kind :named-org
 :org/form-family :family-cooperative-enterprise
 :org/category :cat-labor-coop
 :org/type :secular-community
 :org/scope :national
 :org/region-primary :region-europe
 :org/countries ["CH" "IT" "AR" "GB"]
 :org/founding-date 1934
 :org/founding-note "Founded in the Depression as a mutual credit circle among Swiss SMEs; still operating as a cooperative bank."
 :org/member-count 50000
 :org/member-count-basis "source-pinned, dated: more than 50,000 participating SMEs — commonly given as around 17% of Swiss businesses — transacting in a parallel unit (CHW) alongside francs; a 2013 figure put annual WIR-denominated turnover near CHF 1.43 billion. Current participation and turnover were not confirmed, so treat both as historical markers."
 :org/legal-registration :registered
 :org/governance-model :democratic
 :org/mission-statement "A closed circle of small firms extending each other credit in their own unit of account, counter-cyclical by design — a community whose shared asset is a currency, and the longest-running such system in the world."
 :org/source-name "WIR Bank Genossenschaft profiles / Monneta complementary currency database"
 :org/source-url "https://monneta.org/en/wir-bank-switzerland/"
 :org/source-date "2013"
 :org/source-tier :secondary
 :org/source-caveat "The 50,000 / CHF 1.43bn figures are widely repeated but the most concrete source found is a decade old."
 :org/refresh-checked "2026-07-26"
 :org/refresh-result "Checked Bank WIR's investor-relations and annual-report pages (gb.wir.ch, wir.ch/kennzahlen): they publish balance sheet, profit and equity — 2024 record profit CHF 17.5M, balance sheet CHF 6.6bn — but NOT the number of participating SMEs or WIR-currency turnover. The institution reports what a bank reports; the community metric is not among them, so there is no newer participation figure to pin."
 :org/pinned-on "2026-07-26"
 :org/data-provenance "source-pinned"
 :source/dataset "community-coverage"}

